# Lyric words that look like chord names: Am, Ab, Dm, Bas, Em, C, D, E, G, A
{title: Ab Bas Kar}
{artist: Fixture Sangeet}
{key: Am}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Am]Ab bas kar, Am ki daali pe [G]baithi koyal
[F]Dm se dil tak, Em sa koi [E]geet nahi
A se B tak chalte chalte, C D E G sab bhool gaye
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]Bas ek pal, [Dm]bas ek [G]pal
Ab na [E]ruk, Am ke [Am]neeche
{end_of_chorus}
